SignalLess
=========

SignalLess is built on top of BitChat for Android, an offline-first,
decentralized peer-to-peer messaging application developed by
permissionlesstech and contributors:
https://github.com/permissionlesstech/bitchat-android

The mesh transport, Noise XX encryption, binary wire protocol, packet
relay/gossip layer, and (for private media and live voice) the fragment,
store-and-forward, and interop designs derive from that project and from
its counterpart for iOS/macOS:
https://github.com/permissionlesstech/bitchat

Upstream authors retain copyright in their original contributions.

Modifications for SignalLess include:
  - Application and display naming (SignalLess)
  - Application ID and namespace (com.signalless.app)
  - Removal of the Wear OS companion module
  - Removal of the Play Store metadata (fastlane) directory
  - Launcher icon and monochrome/adaptive icon artwork

